WEBVTT

00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:02.858
Easy Folk Tales. The Gingerbread Man.

00:00:02.858 --> 00:00:05.171
An old woman was baking one day.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:08.964
She made a little man out of gingerbread and put him in the oven.

00:00:08.964 --> 00:00:14.275
When she opened the oven door, the gingerbread man jumped out and ran out of the house.

00:00:14.275 --> 00:00:18.218
"Stop!" cried the old woman, and she ran after him.

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:20.338
Her husband ran after him too.

00:00:20.338 --> 00:00:22.772
But the gingerbread man only laughed.

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:26.630
"Run, run, as fast as you can," he sang.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:29.432
"You can't catch me, I'm the gingerbread man!"

00:00:29.432 --> 00:00:31.080
He ran past a cow.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.941
"Stop, I want to eat you," said the cow.

00:00:33.941 --> 00:00:36.375
But the gingerbread man ran faster.

00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:40.212
He ran past a horse and past some farmers in a field.

00:00:40.212 --> 00:00:43.349
They all ran after him, and nobody could catch him.

00:00:43.349 --> 00:00:45.448
At last he came to a river.

00:00:45.448 --> 00:00:48.626
He could not swim, and everyone was getting closer.

00:00:48.626 --> 00:00:50.753
A fox was sitting by the water.

00:00:50.753 --> 00:00:52.981
"I can help you," said the fox.

00:00:52.981 --> 00:00:56.137
"Jump on my tail, and I will carry you across."

00:00:56.137 --> 00:00:59.002
The gingerbread man jumped on the fox's tail.

00:00:59.002 --> 00:01:00.862
The fox began to swim.

00:01:00.862 --> 00:01:03.701
"The water is getting deeper," said the fox.

00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:06.411
"Climb onto my back, or you will get wet."

00:01:06.411 --> 00:01:07.387
So he did.

00:01:07.387 --> 00:01:10.577
A little later the fox said, "It is deeper still.

00:01:10.577 --> 00:01:12.095
Climb onto my nose."

00:01:12.095 --> 00:01:15.315
And the gingerbread man climbed onto the fox's nose.

00:01:15.315 --> 00:01:21.124
Then the fox threw back his head, opened his mouth, and that was the end of the gingerbread man.
